<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22">
  <!-- One traffic light for labwc's titlebar, generated by coat.
       Rendered once per button per state; {{ fill }} is set by apply_labwc.
       22x22 matches window.button.width/height in themerc, and r=6.5 keeps the disc
       the same visual size as the xbm fallback next to it while being anti-aliased.
       png and svg buttons are NOT recoloured by labwc (only xbm masks are), which is
       exactly why the colour has to be baked in here at generation time. -->
  <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="6.5" fill="#{{ fill }}"/>
</svg>
